---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
---

<div class="container">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Whispers</h1>
    <p>Anonymous encrypted file storage for personal use.</p>
    <p>No account required. Your browser generates and keeps the encryption key locally, so only encrypted data is sent to the server.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <ol class="step-list">
      <li>Select a file from your device.</li>
      <li>Your browser encrypts it before it leaves your device.</li>
      <li>The server stores only the encrypted blob and metadata.</li>
      <li>When you return, your browser can retrieve and decrypt the file locally.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="panel notice">
    <strong>Important:</strong> If you clear your browser storage or lose the local key, your encrypted files cannot be decrypted again. Keep your browser data intact if you want to access them later.
  </section>

  <div class="grid">
    <section class="panel">
      <h2>Share or recover a decryption key</h2>
      <p>This key stays in your browser and is never sent to the server. Copy it to share access with another user, or paste a shared key here to decrypt files from that browser.</p>
      <label class="inline-label" for="keyValue">Current decryption key</label>
      <textarea id="keyValue" rows="4" readonly></textarea>
      <div class="key-actions">
        <button id="copyKeyButton" type="button">Copy key</button>
      </div>
      <label class="inline-label" for="importKeyInput">Paste a shared key</label>
      <textarea id="importKeyInput" rows="4" placeholder="Paste the decryption key shared by another user"></textarea>
      <button id="importKeyButton" type="button">Import key</button>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>Upload a file</h2>
      <p>Select a local file. It will be encrypted in your browser before it is sent.</p>
      <input id="fileInput" class="hidden" type="file">
      <label for="fileInput" class="file-picker">Choose file</label>
      <button id="uploadButton" type="button">Upload encrypted file</button>
      <div id="uploadResult" class="message">Waiting for a file.</div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>Your stored files</h2>
      <p id="state">Preparing your browser key…</p>
      <div id="storageList" class="file-list"></div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="panel hidden" id="downloadPane">
    <h2>Download a file</h2>
    <div class="status-card">
      <strong id="downloadTitle">Select a file</strong>
      <div id="downloadMeta">Choose an entry from the list to decrypt it locally.</div>
    </div>
    <button id="downloadButton" type="button">Download and decrypt</button>
  </section>
</div>
